 microarrays for parallel characterisation of p53 mutants</article-title><source>Proteomics</source><volume>4</volume><fpage>1950</fpage><lpage>58</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15221755</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="b10-bmi-03-325"><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Carrette</surname><given-names>O</given-names></name><name><surname>Demalte</surname><given-names>I</given-names></name><name><surname>Scherl</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Yalkinoglu</surname><given-names>O</given-names></name><name><surname>Corthals</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name><name><surname>Burkhard</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Hochstrasser</surname><given-names>DF</given-names></name><name><surname>Sanchez</surname><given-names>JC</given-names></name></person-group><year>2003</year><article-title>A panel of cerebrospinal fluid potential biomarkers for the diagnosis of Alzheimer&#x02019;s disease</article-title><source>Proteomics</source><volume>3</volume><fpage>1486</fpage><lpage>94</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12923774</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="b11-bmi-03-325"><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Choi</surname><given-names>JK</given-names></name><name><surname>Yu</surname><given-names>U</given-names></name><name><surname>Yoo</surname><given-names>OJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Kim</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name></person-group><year>2005</year><article-title>Differential coexpression analysis using microarray data and its application to human cancer</article-title><source>Bioinformatics</source><volume>21</volume><fpage>4348</fpage><lpage>55</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16234317</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="b12-bmi-03-325"><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Clark</surname><